the PIPE Units for its own account and not on behalf of any U.S. person, and the sale has not been pre-arranged with a purchaser in the
United States.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

