<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">5.4 <U>Information</U>. Each Investor and its advisors, if any, have been
furnished with all materials relating to the business, finances and operations of the Company and other information each Investor deemed
material to making an informed investment decision regarding its purchase of the PIPE Units which have been requested by each Investor.
Each Investor acknowledges that Investor has reviewed the SEC Documents, which are available on the SEC&rsquo;s website (www.sec.gov)
