in this Article VI only to the extent it is readily apparent from a reading of the disclosure that such disclosure is applicable to such
other sections and subsections.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&nbsp;</P>

