regarding &ldquo;non-GAAP financial measures&rdquo; (as such term is defined by the rules and regulations of the SEC), if any, comply
with Regulation G of the Exchange Act and Item 10 of Regulation S-K of the Securities Act, to the extent applicable. Each of the SEC Documents
discloses all material off-balance sheet transactions, arrangements, obligations (including contingent obligations), and other relationships
